er farm</span>#<span style='color:#5B9BD5'>部署使用 HTTPS 的多服务器负载平衡 Office Online Server 场Deploy a multi-server, load-balanced Office Online Server farm that uses HTTPS</span>#*<span style='color:#5B9BD5'>步骤 4：配置主机Step 4: Configure the host</span>*":[132,133],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>部署 Office Online Server 场Deploy the Office Online Server farm</span>#<span style='color:#5B9BD5'>部署使用 HTTPS 的多服务器负载平衡 Office Online Server 场Deploy a multi-server, load-balanced Office Online Server farm that uses HTTPS</span>#*<span style='color:#5B9BD5'>步骤 4：配置主机Step 4: Configure the host</span>*#{1}":[133,133],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>如果您看到\"500 Web 服务异常\"或\"500.21 - 内部服务器错误\"消息If you see \"500 Web Service Exceptions\" or \"500.21 - Internal Server Error\" messages</span>":[134,137],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>如果您看到\"500 Web 服务异常\"或\"500.21 - 内部服务器错误\"消息If you see \"500 Web Service Exceptions\" or \"500.21 - Internal Server Error\" messages</span>#{1}":[135,137],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>另请参阅See also</span>":[138,142],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>另请参阅See also</span>#{1}":[139,142]},"outlinks":[{"title":"批量许可服务中心 (VLSC)","target":"http://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?LinkId=256561","line":28},{"title":"Volume Licensing Service Center (VLSC)","target":"http://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?LinkId=256561","line":28},{"title":"设置为在此服务器上自动启动","target":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?LinkId=620769","line":34},{"title":"to start automatically","target":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?LinkId=620769","line":34},{"title":"Microsoft 下载中心","target":"http://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?LinkId=798136","line":39},{"title":"Microsoft Download Center","target":"http://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?LinkId=798136","line":39},{"title":"http://servername","target":"http://servername/","line":59},{"title":"http://servername\\*\\*。","target":"https://docs.microsoft.com/zh-cn/officeonlineserver/deploy-office-online-server","line":59},{"title":"http://servername.contoso.com","target":"http://ser